!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!src/
!src/**
# Published evidence the findings page renders from. Reports only, never
# imagery or embedding stores, which stay mounted read-only at runtime.
!docs/
!docs/results/
!docs/results/*.json
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
